{"ref":"BDB, קָהָה","hw":"קָהָה","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קָהָה</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. be blunt, dull (</strong>NH id.<em>;</em> Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">קְהָא</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܩܗܳܐ</span> <strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. 3 fpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּקְהֶינָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.29\">Je 31:29</a>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:30\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.30\">30</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 18:2\" href=\"/Ezekiel.18.2\">Ez 18:2</a> (all of teeth).<br><strong>Pi.</strong>  in sense of <strong>Qal</strong>: Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">קֵהָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:10\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.10\">Ec 10:10</a> <em>if the iron be blunt</em>.","next":"BDB, קֵהָיוֹן","prev":"BDB, מִקְדָּשׁ²"}